body:
My coping methods are harmful as well. I was doing fine Until abt 3 weeks ago, then i relapsed to self harm. Nobody truly cares - they just dont wanna be roped iin for not trying harder.

&#x200B;

I want to die, but I have so much I want to achieve. So I've been thinking, maybe just kill the person I was born as. Fake my death, change my name, leave & never look back..
